§ `Section 406: frauds by officers`

-- (c): "since or within 2 months before the date of any unsatisfied judgment or order" for payment of money against the company.
-- The judgment is dated 15 March 2026. "Within 2 months before" runs from the corresponding date 2 months earlier, 15 January 2026, to the day before (P6).
#ASSERT `s 406(c) the property was concealed or removed since or within 2 months before the date of the judgment or order` (Date 15 3 2026) (Date 15 3 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 406(c) the property was concealed or removed since or within 2 months before the date of the judgment or order` (Date 10 4 2026) (Date 15 3 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 406(c) the property was concealed or removed since or within 2 months before the date of the judgment or order` (Date 14 3 2026) (Date 15 3 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 406(c) the property was concealed or removed since or within 2 months before the date of the judgment or order` (Date 15 1 2026) (Date 15 3 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 406(c) the property was concealed or removed since or within 2 months before the date of the judgment or order` (Date 14 1 2026) (Date 15 3 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- A judgment dated 30 April 2026: 2 months before has no 30 February, so it begins on the last day of February (P4), 28 February 2026.
#ASSERT `s 406(c) the property was concealed or removed since or within 2 months before the date of the judgment or order` (Date 28 2 2026) (Date 30 4 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 406(c) the property was concealed or removed since or within 2 months before the date of the judgment or order` (Date 27 2 2026) (Date 30 4 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- A leap year: a judgment dated 30 April 2024; 2 months before is 29 February 2024, the last day of February.
#ASSERT `s 406(c) the property was concealed or removed since or within 2 months before the date of the judgment or order` (Date 29 2 2024) (Date 30 4 2024) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 406(c) the property was concealed or removed since or within 2 months before the date of the judgment or order` (Date 28 2 2024) (Date 30 4 2024) EQUALS JUST FALSE

